# ============================================================
# .dockerignore — 根 compose 构建上下文裁剪（repo 根 = build context）
#
# 三个应用镜像（web / modeling-server / webhook-agent）的 Dockerfile 都
# 需要复制 itwinjs-core 中被 pnpm `link:` 引用的包目录（含宿主 rush
# build 产物 lib/），因此 context 必须是仓库根。本文件把 context 收敛为：
#   luban-cad/  modeling-server/  webhook-agent/
#   itwinjs-core/ 中被 link: 引用的 15 个包目录
#
# 排除项里最关键的是 itwinjs-core/common/（rush pnpm store，数 GB，
# 且为 Windows junction 链接，不可 COPY）与所有 node_modules/
# （pnpm symlink 指向宿主绝对路径，容器内必须重新 install）。
# 注意：**/dist 全局排除 —— 镜像内一律重新构建；宿主 dist 不进镜像。
# ============================================================

# --- 白名单骨架：其余根级条目一律不进 context ---
*
!luban-cad
!modeling-server
!webhook-agent
!itwinjs-core

# --- itwinjs-core 仅保留被 link: 引用的包（源码 + 宿主预构建 lib/）---
itwinjs-core/*
!itwinjs-core/core
!itwinjs-core/editor
!itwinjs-core/presentation
!itwinjs-core/ui

itwinjs-core/core/*
!itwinjs-core/core/backend
!itwinjs-core/core/bentley
!itwinjs-core/core/common
!itwinjs-core/core/frontend
!itwinjs-core/core/geometry
!itwinjs-core/core/i18n
!itwinjs-core/core/quantity
!itwinjs-core/core/ecschema-metadata
!itwinjs-core/core/ecschema-rpc
!itwinjs-core/core/ecschema-rpcinterface
!itwinjs-core/core/webgl-compatibility
!itwinjs-core/core/orbitgt

itwinjs-core/editor/*
!itwinjs-core/editor/backend
!itwinjs-core/editor/common
!itwinjs-core/editor/frontend

itwinjs-core/presentation/*
!itwinjs-core/presentation/common
!itwinjs-core/presentation/frontend

itwinjs-core/ui/*
!itwinjs-core/ui/appui-abstract

# --- 通用排除（后置规则优先于上面的白名单）---
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.pnpm-store
**/*.log
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/briefcase-cache
luban-cad/apps/web/azure-pipelines
modeling-server/briefcase-cache
webhook-agent/briefcase-cache
